WEBVTT

00:02.437 --> 00:04.037
Let's hear your numbers!

00:04.037 --> 00:05.287
One!

00:07.907 --> 00:09.517
Trainee Ariane?

00:10.727 --> 00:12.107
Trainee Ariane!

00:12.107 --> 00:13.277
Yes?!

00:13.277 --> 00:15.717
Don't let your guard down 
just because it's early morning.

00:15.717 --> 00:17.807
Here, that means immediate death!

00:18.217 --> 00:19.727
Ranger!

00:19.727 --> 00:20.917
Again, numbers!

00:20.917 --> 00:22.097
One!

00:22.097 --> 00:23.387
Two!

00:23.777 --> 00:24.687
All right.

00:24.687 --> 00:26.797
Then we'll start today's training.

00:27.447 --> 00:30.187
<i>Is it because it's so early?</i>

00:30.187 --> 00:34.987
<i>Black, I mean Ray, seems even 
more resplendent than usual.</i>

00:35.347 --> 00:37.897
Ariane, do you have a fever?

00:37.897 --> 00:39.167
Are you okay?

00:40.417 --> 00:42.667
There's nothing wrong with me!

00:43.197 --> 00:46.147
I'm fine, like always!

00:46.147 --> 00:48.707
{(\fad(0,2570)}Always... always...

00:47.537 --> 00:50.067
Yes, so that's it.

00:50.517 --> 00:52.317
This makes it crystal clear.

00:53.207 --> 00:56.587
This is a treasure trove of information.

00:56.997 --> 00:58.187
Maria...

00:58.727 --> 01:00.097
Maria!

01:01.087 --> 01:02.497
What is it?

01:02.497 --> 01:03.817
Please take this.

01:16.357 --> 01:18.237
Just like I thought.

01:18.557 --> 01:20.727
I need to hurry there as well!

01:25.417 --> 01:26.487
Here I go!

01:29.807 --> 01:31.527
Mother?!

01:31.527 --> 01:32.807
Rebecca?

01:33.297 --> 01:34.987
Going somewhere?

01:35.007 --> 01:40.007
N-No. Why would I want to go 
anywhere that isn't here?

01:40.007 --> 01:42.287
The meeting is about to start.

01:42.287 --> 01:43.757
Hurry up and change right away.

01:43.757 --> 01:44.957
Outrageous.

01:44.957 --> 01:46.837
What is that getup even supposed to be?

01:48.687 --> 01:50.567
Why...?

02:39.047 --> 02:41.167
By the way, where did Abbie go?

02:41.167 --> 02:43.307
Abbie is the chairwoman of operations,

02:43.307 --> 02:45.807
so during the tournament, 
she's super busy.

02:45.807 --> 02:47.197
That sounds tough.

02:47.197 --> 02:49.747
So, where are we supposed to go?

02:49.747 --> 02:51.317
A place where there's space.

02:54.447 --> 02:58.867
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

02:59.157 --> 03:02.957
<b>Episode 3
The Boy Who Is the World’s Strongest Sorcerer
Keeps Winning With His Team</b>

03:19.367 --> 03:22.267
Ariane, are you okay?

03:22.267 --> 03:25.767
Okay... okay... okay...

03:27.177 --> 03:29.907
Yes! More or less!

03:29.907 --> 03:31.367
Trainee Ariane!

03:32.017 --> 03:35.457
The Magicks War is guerrilla warfare 
with multiple combatants!

03:35.457 --> 03:37.287
Be aware of your surroundings 
at all times!

03:37.287 --> 03:39.897
Don't focus too much
on what's in front of you!

03:41.157 --> 03:43.737
If you can't, be prepared to die!

03:43.737 --> 03:45.307
Ranger!

03:45.307 --> 03:46.657
Then let's go again!

03:46.657 --> 03:47.707
Ranger...

03:49.167 --> 03:50.507
What's wrong?

03:50.507 --> 03:53.167
Um, uh, nothing...

03:54.157 --> 03:55.287
Ariane?

03:55.787 --> 03:58.677
Uh... well...

03:59.377 --> 04:00.397
Do you have a fever?!

04:00.397 --> 04:01.177
No!

04:01.497 --> 04:03.087
I'm fine!

04:04.437 --> 04:06.467
Good. Then let's go!

04:06.467 --> 04:07.897
Ranger!

04:09.897 --> 04:11.657
<i>What is this?</i>

04:11.657 --> 04:14.307
<i>This endless pounding in my chest?</i>

04:20.377 --> 04:22.587
Shall we continue?

04:38.377 --> 04:40.217
<i>Well then, Ariane.</i>

04:40.217 --> 04:41.717
<i>What will you do now?</i>

04:44.067 --> 04:45.327
Got you!

04:49.097 --> 04:51.677
Boo. What a shame.

04:52.037 --> 04:52.947
Stella.

04:53.397 --> 04:55.127
There is no need to speak out loud.

04:55.127 --> 04:57.077
You'll be heard by your opponents.

04:57.077 --> 04:58.607
Oh, right.

04:59.467 --> 05:01.467
I was having so much fun that I forgot.

05:01.467 --> 05:03.217
I'll remember next time.

05:03.217 --> 05:04.227
Okay.

05:04.227 --> 05:05.617
All right!

05:05.617 --> 05:07.707
<i>That's my little sister for you.</i>

05:07.707 --> 05:12.107
<i>So adorable! I want to reach out 
and pat her head despite myself.</i>

05:14.457 --> 05:16.467
So, Ray...

05:16.467 --> 05:17.877
Yes?

05:17.877 --> 05:21.507
This is... well, it's very embarrassing.

05:21.507 --> 05:23.577
But we've got no choice.

05:23.577 --> 05:25.757
I suppose so.

05:25.757 --> 05:27.627
You were really something today.

05:27.627 --> 05:30.267
I thought I was really going to die.

05:30.267 --> 05:34.007
It's amazing you could run 
away from us for an hour.

05:34.257 --> 05:36.277
Yeah. You really did well.

05:37.197 --> 05:40.277
My reputation as a maiden 
was riding on it.

05:40.857 --> 05:42.217
So, Ray...

05:42.217 --> 05:43.337
What is it?

05:43.737 --> 05:46.497
Am I actually getting stronger at all?

05:46.847 --> 05:48.037
Of course.

05:48.257 --> 05:51.237
In just two days, you learned to
dodge us two siblings.

05:51.547 --> 05:53.777
You are definitely improving.

05:54.657 --> 05:56.447
Is that so?

06:00.237 --> 06:02.287
Then come and get me...

06:09.917 --> 06:10.897
Ray.

06:11.437 --> 06:12.467
You'll get cold.

06:12.937 --> 06:15.047
Thank you.

06:16.607 --> 06:18.327
This is bad.

06:19.437 --> 06:22.527
You completely snuck up on me.

06:22.527 --> 06:24.197
Is something on your mind?

06:24.727 --> 06:27.277
I never talked about it, did I?

06:27.277 --> 06:29.527
The reason for why I asked you for this.

06:30.317 --> 06:34.707
I want to try fighting together, 
with you and Amelia.

06:34.707 --> 06:36.217
More importantly,

06:37.397 --> 06:39.957
I want to change myself.

06:41.287 --> 06:45.257
I didn't know how I ought to 
behave as part of the nobility,

06:45.257 --> 06:47.337
so I've always tried to copy Amelia.

06:47.337 --> 06:50.637
Never showing anyone any weakness, 
keeping on that straight and narrow path.

06:51.217 --> 06:53.547
Becoming strong...

06:53.547 --> 06:55.907
That was something I thought 
I was doing for Amelia.

06:55.907 --> 06:58.477
That it was my duty to her as a friend.

06:59.997 --> 07:06.477
But her abilities were so 
much more amazing than mine.

07:06.997 --> 07:10.767
She forced me to see me that 
I had drowned in my pride.

07:11.747 --> 07:14.787
And that my jealousy of her abilities was

07:14.787 --> 07:17.517
proof of me being
an incredibly pathetic being.

07:17.967 --> 07:20.167
The one who changed her...

07:20.167 --> 07:22.247
The one who saved her heart...

07:22.647 --> 07:24.737
Ray, it was you.

07:25.637 --> 07:29.797
I thought if I went with you, 
maybe I could change too.

07:31.577 --> 07:33.877
How selfish is that?

07:34.887 --> 07:35.997
Ariane...

07:37.027 --> 07:38.377
Just stay like this.

07:38.377 --> 07:39.287
Listen.

07:39.657 --> 07:43.517
Envying someone else is 
nothing to be ashamed about.

07:44.077 --> 07:46.377
Like being jealous of people 
who are living in peace.

07:46.717 --> 07:50.657
I also have times when 
I can't stand myself.

07:52.397 --> 07:55.517
That's the best time to lean on someone.

07:57.507 --> 07:59.107
I'm allowed to?

08:03.137 --> 08:04.167
Yes.

08:04.877 --> 08:08.787
Ray... thank you so much.

08:12.007 --> 08:14.677
Ariane, tomorrow is another early day.

08:15.367 --> 08:16.437
Shall we go back?

08:17.587 --> 08:18.587
Yes.

08:18.587 --> 08:19.857
Right. Then let's go.

08:22.247 --> 08:23.437
What is it?

08:23.437 --> 08:25.057
Uh...

08:25.427 --> 08:29.517
May we, until we get back to our rooms?

08:30.517 --> 08:31.817
That's fine.

08:31.817 --> 08:33.417
Let's do our best tomorrow too.

08:34.857 --> 08:35.847
Yes, sir!

08:38.527 --> 08:40.327
USA!

08:41.117 --> 08:42.707
That's ominous...

08:45.937 --> 08:46.967
Ow...

08:50.047 --> 08:51.327
Amelia.

08:53.117 --> 08:55.157
Lieselotte.

08:55.157 --> 08:56.467
Are you all right?

08:57.427 --> 08:59.067
I'm fine.

08:59.067 --> 09:00.307
Are you doing some reading?

09:01.217 --> 09:03.037
You're reading her too, right?

09:03.037 --> 09:03.977
Luna Ether?

09:04.447 --> 09:07.477
Yes. You like her too?

09:07.477 --> 09:12.357
Ray introduced me... then I got hooked.

09:12.357 --> 09:15.227
What an honor.

09:15.997 --> 09:19.367
I do not get to meet my readers directly.

09:20.517 --> 09:21.497
Here.

09:24.517 --> 09:27.207
This is the latest one. 
It hasn't hit the market yet.

09:28.127 --> 09:29.657
You may have it.

09:30.877 --> 09:37.637
The unknown romance writer shrouded 
in mystery, Luna Ether, is me.

09:37.637 --> 09:38.637
What?

09:38.867 --> 09:41.147
Whaaat?!

09:46.217 --> 09:47.877
I won't lose.

09:47.877 --> 09:50.067
I will... get one hit in!

10:05.237 --> 10:07.267
Al, are you all right?

10:09.087 --> 10:11.457
I'm okay.

10:11.457 --> 10:12.547
Albert.

10:14.907 --> 10:16.437
Can we talk?

10:23.617 --> 10:25.807
Trainee Ariane, you're too slow!

10:34.377 --> 10:36.187
Not bad.

10:39.457 --> 10:40.867
Taking notes...

10:47.767 --> 10:49.327
Very nice...

11:08.977 --> 11:13.307
You've really pushed yourself in 
these past 14 days of training.

11:13.307 --> 11:14.687
Ranger!

11:14.687 --> 11:16.687
We will now enter our final training!

11:16.687 --> 11:18.117
Ranger!

11:18.407 --> 11:22.457
Trainee Ariane, you will form 
a team with Sister White Gray.

11:22.457 --> 11:23.557
Ranger!

11:23.557 --> 11:25.657
The ban on magic is lifted!

11:25.957 --> 11:30.707
In the deepest part of Dogma Forest, 
I will await you under the legend-y tree.

11:30.707 --> 11:33.097
Once you are fully prepared 
and determined,

11:33.097 --> 11:36.927
use everything you've got and scatter 
the rose pinned to my chest!

11:36.927 --> 11:37.977
Ranger!

11:38.687 --> 11:40.717
I'm coming, Master Black!

11:41.837 --> 11:42.977
Ogre!

11:53.237 --> 11:55.537
Put everything into blocking this!

12:12.467 --> 12:15.317
This is... a decoy?!

12:20.487 --> 12:21.487
Stella?!

12:21.487 --> 12:22.757
Ariane!

12:22.757 --> 12:24.207
Now's your chance!

12:24.207 --> 12:26.437
Ariane!

12:32.527 --> 12:35.867
I can't hold on longer!

12:35.867 --> 12:37.777
Ranger!

12:38.117 --> 12:40.807
Ogre Scintilla!

12:52.687 --> 12:54.917
Impressive, Trainee Ariane!

12:54.917 --> 12:57.227
You did it!

12:57.227 --> 13:00.057
This concludes the
"Chapter in Survival Training"

13:00.057 --> 13:02.937
of the Ainsworth-style boot camp!

13:06.497 --> 13:09.277
Ranger!

13:14.877 --> 13:15.817
Yes.

13:15.817 --> 13:19.197
Your Butterfly Effect 
has really improved.

13:19.197 --> 13:20.677
It's magnificent.

13:24.417 --> 13:29.467
I imagine you manifested 
this because you had to.

13:29.467 --> 13:30.207
Huh?

13:30.207 --> 13:32.737
You don't have to come here anymore.

13:32.737 --> 13:34.797
Are we done?

13:34.797 --> 13:35.957
We are.

13:35.957 --> 13:38.457
I taught you the bare necessities.

13:38.457 --> 13:40.207
Now it's up to you.

13:40.487 --> 13:43.297
This also means I repaid 
Ray White for his favor.

13:43.297 --> 13:46.187
Speaking of, what exactly is your 
relationship with Ray White?

13:46.187 --> 13:47.227
We are lovers.

13:49.747 --> 13:51.037
I lied.

13:51.377 --> 13:53.927
Our relationship is such that you 
don't have to worry about it.

13:54.717 --> 13:56.917
P-Please don't do that.

13:56.917 --> 14:00.117
It's so hard to tell when you're joking.

14:00.117 --> 14:01.457
Apologies.

14:01.457 --> 14:03.737
But despite being an Ordinary,

14:03.737 --> 14:07.127
he is the youngest in history to 
become one of the Seven Grand Sorcerers.

14:07.127 --> 14:09.997
I think a betrothal to 
him would be accepted.

14:09.997 --> 14:11.237
B-Betrothal?!

14:11.237 --> 14:12.877
I think it would be a good match.

14:14.267 --> 14:16.087
You really think so?

14:16.087 --> 14:18.547
I do. I'm rooting for you.

14:18.547 --> 14:20.017
Oh, come on!

14:22.477 --> 14:24.517
I wish you the best of luck.

14:25.467 --> 14:28.817
My time here was short, 
but you've done so much for me.

14:28.817 --> 14:30.547
It went by so fast.

14:30.547 --> 14:32.517
We're going to miss you.

14:32.517 --> 14:33.757
Ariane.

14:34.087 --> 14:35.007
Yes?

14:35.007 --> 14:36.337
Good luck.

14:38.027 --> 14:40.067
Yes, ma'am!

14:41.787 --> 14:45.407
Big Brother, I promise 
I'll come cheer for you!

14:45.407 --> 14:47.777
Please win this thing, Ariane.

14:47.777 --> 14:49.317
Of course!

14:49.317 --> 14:50.877
We will!

14:52.477 --> 14:53.667
Shall we go?

14:54.967 --> 14:56.917
Yes.

14:59.927 --> 15:02.637
We should get back too.

15:02.637 --> 15:04.477
I can finally go home.

15:04.477 --> 15:05.887
What are you doing?

15:06.817 --> 15:09.537
You're not from around here, are you?

15:09.537 --> 15:10.967
Well...

15:10.967 --> 15:12.557
Uh...

15:12.557 --> 15:13.887
Stare.

15:12.557 --> 15:13.637
This is...

15:13.637 --> 15:14.447
That...

15:14.447 --> 15:15.167
That!

15:15.167 --> 15:15.937
What?!

15:15.937 --> 15:17.667
Doesn't that hurt?!

15:17.667 --> 15:19.697
N-No.

15:19.697 --> 15:21.837
That is <i>so</i> cool!

15:22.447 --> 15:23.807
Thank you.

15:25.697 --> 15:28.037
We need return to our lands.

15:28.037 --> 15:28.827
Huh?

15:28.827 --> 15:29.947
Farewell!

15:29.947 --> 15:30.707
Wha?!

15:42.007 --> 15:43.097
Let's do our best!

15:43.097 --> 15:44.837
Ranger!

15:44.837 --> 15:46.747
Stare...

15:51.967 --> 15:56.837
<i>A-A-Ariane?!</i>

15:57.317 --> 15:58.977
It's finally time!

15:58.977 --> 16:02.577
This feels like the beginning of 
the tournament, right Elisa?!

16:02.577 --> 16:03.717
Yeah...

16:03.717 --> 16:05.077
Is something wrong?

16:06.737 --> 16:08.797
Um... well...

16:13.487 --> 16:16.437
This is the first ever Magicks War!

16:16.437 --> 16:17.647
We're just in the preliminaries,

16:17.647 --> 16:20.507
but the stadium is completely packed 
and tensions are running high!

16:20.507 --> 16:22.697
I'm so nervous!

16:22.697 --> 16:25.867
Sheesh. What reason do you 
have for being nervous?

16:25.867 --> 16:27.577
Right, here we go!

16:27.577 --> 16:28.737
Aye-aye!

16:28.737 --> 16:30.047
And a one and a...

16:30.047 --> 16:33.357
Amelia! Fight!

16:33.357 --> 16:34.297
Good luck!

16:34.297 --> 16:35.607
This is it, Elisa!

16:34.787 --> 16:35.607
Yeah.

16:35.607 --> 16:37.657
Of course I'm for Ray 
and his team, but...

16:37.657 --> 16:39.357
Also for Evi and Albert!

16:39.357 --> 16:40.137
Exactly.

16:40.717 --> 16:43.147
Wow, this place is so huge!

16:43.147 --> 16:45.147
This stadium is amazing!

16:45.147 --> 16:48.167
It is. And it's packed with people.

16:48.167 --> 16:50.647
I didn't imagine it to be this big.

16:50.647 --> 16:52.937
I'm going to go look for Lydia.

16:52.937 --> 16:54.147
Stella!

16:54.147 --> 16:56.657
That girl...

16:56.657 --> 17:00.007
Well, she has her ticket, 
so let's wait by our seats.

17:00.007 --> 17:01.117
Right.

17:01.117 --> 17:01.917
Now...

17:02.217 --> 17:04.477
Where could Liese and the others be?

17:04.477 --> 17:06.147
Are you here all by yourself?

17:06.147 --> 17:06.917
Huh?

17:06.917 --> 17:09.717
Are your mother and father not with you?

17:10.107 --> 17:12.047
Shall we look for them together?

17:12.047 --> 17:13.837
No need to fret.

17:13.837 --> 17:14.427
Huh?

17:14.427 --> 17:16.407
I'm grateful for your concern.

17:16.817 --> 17:19.437
So conscientious for your young age.

17:19.437 --> 17:22.437
There is only one...

17:22.437 --> 17:25.947
For today's event, we have members 
of all three top noble houses,

17:25.947 --> 17:29.357
as well as a wide variety of 
other personages in attendance.

17:29.357 --> 17:30.937
And most impressively,

17:30.937 --> 17:33.507
with us here today is none 
other than Olivia Arnold,

17:33.507 --> 17:36.107
the second crown princess 
of the royal Arnold family!

17:34.667 --> 17:38.467
Jeez, where did Rebecca 
and Maria walk off to?

17:36.297 --> 17:40.307
Everybody, please give the princess 
a royal round of applause!

17:41.247 --> 17:42.457
She's not here!

17:42.457 --> 17:44.147
Princess Olivia is not here!

17:44.147 --> 17:45.457
What?!

17:45.457 --> 17:48.997
F-Find her!

17:49.857 --> 17:54.377
I can't properly cheer for my Ray 
if I stay in that stuffy place!

17:58.547 --> 18:00.057
Are you okay?

18:01.747 --> 18:03.317
Y-Yes.

18:06.307 --> 18:07.697
Once again!

18:07.697 --> 18:13.087
From Arnold Magic Academy, I, 
Dina Sera, will be your announcer today.

18:13.087 --> 18:16.247
And I, Carocaro, 
will be providing commentary!

18:17.357 --> 18:19.527
Miss Caroline.

18:19.527 --> 18:20.587
Yes?

18:20.587 --> 18:22.217
Who are those people next to you?

18:22.217 --> 18:23.277
Oh, them?

18:23.277 --> 18:24.307
Don't worry about me.

18:24.307 --> 18:27.417
I'm just an super ultra amazing 
beautiful woman passing through.

18:27.417 --> 18:29.737
I'm a hyper-competent maid 
who happened to be here.

18:29.737 --> 18:31.967
Don't worry about us. At all.

18:32.397 --> 18:33.577
Fine, then.

18:34.037 --> 18:36.487
What are you doing here, Rebecca?

18:36.487 --> 18:39.257
The nobles' seats are 
so far from the stage.

18:39.257 --> 18:42.337
I figured I should be watching 
from the front row.

18:42.887 --> 18:44.117
And then...

18:44.777 --> 18:47.727
There seems to be a lot I 
need to see for myself.

18:46.527 --> 18:47.727
Kinokon!

18:47.727 --> 18:49.387
I-I see.

18:49.387 --> 18:50.237
Kinokon!

18:50.237 --> 18:51.547
Hey, Liese.

18:51.547 --> 18:53.637
I never expected you to come.

18:53.637 --> 18:55.167
I'm a bit shocked.

18:55.167 --> 18:56.437
Oh really?

18:56.437 --> 18:58.147
Really shocked!

18:57.037 --> 18:58.427
Don't be annoying, Dumbpink.

18:58.427 --> 18:59.237
Ow...

18:59.237 --> 19:01.477
I'm not annoying!

19:01.477 --> 19:02.887
You're beyond annoying.

19:02.887 --> 19:05.237
Lydia, why are you always so mean?!

19:05.587 --> 19:07.777
You've changed.

19:07.777 --> 19:09.247
Have I?

19:09.247 --> 19:11.097
I think it's good.

19:11.097 --> 19:12.497
Carocaro thinks so too!

19:12.497 --> 19:13.877
Shut it, Dumbpink.

19:14.297 --> 19:15.387
Really?

19:15.387 --> 19:17.037
You're Ray's...

19:17.037 --> 19:17.767
Yup!

19:17.767 --> 19:19.737
Ray White is my older brother.

19:23.207 --> 19:26.057
Let's be friends, Stella White!

19:26.057 --> 19:27.437
Forever and ever!

19:27.437 --> 19:29.367
Yeah! Forever!

19:31.357 --> 19:32.997
Hey, it's Maria.

19:32.997 --> 19:34.917
Princess... Olivia?

19:37.197 --> 19:39.357
What? Do you two know each other?

19:39.357 --> 19:41.617
Well...

19:42.007 --> 19:45.527
And now, I will explain 
this event's rules.

19:45.527 --> 19:48.387
We're using this ancient castle 
near the border as the battle ground!

19:48.387 --> 19:50.597
Each team consists of three people!

19:50.597 --> 19:53.387
The teams will fight each other for five 
magical devices placed in the castle.

19:53.677 --> 19:57.687
The team that captures the most 
in the allotted time wins!

19:58.787 --> 20:03.917
These magical devices need to be charged 
with a certain amount of prima materia.

20:03.917 --> 20:07.017
Charging will always require 
a fixed amount of time.

20:07.017 --> 20:08.157
I see.

20:08.157 --> 20:10.597
So it's not affected by 
anyone's skill level.

20:10.597 --> 20:11.977
That makes it fair.

20:11.977 --> 20:16.267
The person who's charging it will 
be defenseless for the duration.

20:16.527 --> 20:21.607
So assigning roles for attack and defense 
are really important for a team.

20:21.607 --> 20:22.777
That's right.

20:22.777 --> 20:24.417
Fighting prowess is not everything.

20:24.417 --> 20:26.787
This battle also requires strategy.

20:30.167 --> 20:32.307
You did it, Al!

20:31.457 --> 20:32.937
You did it, Evi!

20:32.937 --> 20:34.847
Nice gains!

20:34.267 --> 20:35.707
What? Zui?

20:36.507 --> 20:38.927
Al! Al!

20:37.367 --> 20:38.697
Hey, you!

20:39.677 --> 20:42.587
What if you render all 
opponents unable to move?

20:42.587 --> 20:45.347
Wouldn't that guarantee your victory?

20:45.797 --> 20:49.067
Yes. In that case, you can charge in 
to your heart's content.

20:52.067 --> 20:53.677
White!

20:52.977 --> 20:54.877
Amelia!

20:54.337 --> 20:56.207
You're the best!

20:56.207 --> 20:59.187
You're definitely going to win!

20:57.927 --> 21:01.387
Elisa! Ray's team is unstoppable!

21:01.387 --> 21:03.367
Yeah, they're all doing great.

21:03.367 --> 21:06.547
Oh wow! Ray really is strong, huh?

21:06.547 --> 21:11.437
I see. So that Amelia is Ariane's rival.

21:12.947 --> 21:14.787
You loser nobles!

21:14.787 --> 21:16.247
Look at him and weep!

21:16.247 --> 21:18.257
Take in the true power of my Ray,

21:18.257 --> 21:21.237
the one you looked down upon 
for being an Ordinary!

21:24.777 --> 21:26.187
What are you doing here?

21:26.187 --> 21:27.457
What's this?

21:28.637 --> 21:30.337
Fran!

21:28.637 --> 21:30.337
Old Fran.

21:30.337 --> 21:33.637
As if I'd miss Ray's big day.

21:33.637 --> 21:35.207
Right, Liese?

21:35.207 --> 21:37.147
It's been a while, Francoise.

21:37.487 --> 21:40.167
<i>We've got more children here now.</i>

21:37.847 --> 21:39.117
Jeez, you're in the way.

21:39.117 --> 21:41.177
You're really not cute, Lydia.

21:40.167 --> 21:41.627
<i>I won't even say anything...</i>

21:41.177 --> 21:42.857
That's right, Lydia.

21:42.857 --> 21:44.167
Shut up, Dumbpink.

21:44.167 --> 21:47.687
And we've already made it to the 
final round of the Magicks War!

21:47.687 --> 21:49.537
The final two competing are...

21:49.537 --> 21:52.407
Team Algren, led by Ray!

21:53.847 --> 21:57.197
The doors to a new era 
are about to open here!

21:56.667 --> 21:57.417
Excuse me, Beautiful Lady?

21:57.697 --> 21:59.497
Going up against him is Team Forst,

21:59.497 --> 22:01.677
a champion of Magic Chevalier.

22:02.367 --> 22:04.867
So that's Lucas Forst, huh?

22:03.817 --> 22:05.667
Hey, Fran!

22:06.687 --> 22:08.887
And the final round has begun!

22:12.357 --> 22:15.247
And right out of the gate, 
both sides are rushing in!

22:15.247 --> 22:16.717
If they keep this up...

22:17.237 --> 22:18.927
<i>I knew it would be you, Lucas Forst.</i>

22:18.927 --> 22:20.197
<i>Ray White!</i>

22:22.327 --> 22:24.577
<i>Iceblade!</i>

22:24.577 --> 22:26.827
Peerless Blade!

22:31.887 --> 22:33.117
What's this?!

22:33.117 --> 22:36.107
Instead of crossing swords, both 
of them continued to rush forward!

22:43.617 --> 22:45.187
We knew you'd come!

22:45.187 --> 22:46.097
We've been waiting for you!

22:46.857 --> 22:48.017
Ray!

23:48.727 --> 23:49.517
Evi here.

23:48.747 --> 23:53.797
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.747 --> 23:53.797
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:49.517 --> 23:50.377
This is Albert.

23:50.377 --> 23:51.937
I am Lucas Forst.

23:51.937 --> 23:53.777
It's time for the preview 
of the next episode!

23:53.777 --> 23:54.547
It's finally!

23:54.547 --> 23:55.297
Time!

23:55.297 --> 23:56.217
I'm fired up!

23:56.217 --> 23:57.177
Let's do this!

23:57.177 --> 23:57.987
A hot battle!

23:57.987 --> 23:58.837
Our rivalry is hot!

23:58.837 --> 24:00.467
And the pecs we trained are also hot!

24:02.427 --> 24:03.047
Next time on...

24:03.047 --> 24:05.307
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World</i>

24:05.307 --> 24:09.097
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

24:05.307 --> 24:06.407
<i>Two!</i>

24:07.087 --> 24:09.087
You and us, in episode 4!

24:09.087 --> 24:11.497
"The Boy Who Is the World's 
Strongest Sorcerer and His Friends

24:09.097 --> 24:15.007
<b>Episode 4
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest Sorcerer
and His Friends Converse With Their Fists</b>

24:11.497 --> 24:13.387
Converse with Their Fists!"
